{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Python code to GNU C++11 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following PyPy 3 code to GNU C++11 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original PyPy 3 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nfrom functools import lru_cache\nimport itertools\n\ndef invnum(seq):\n    N = len(seq)\n    res = 0\n    for i in range(N):\n        for j in range(i+1, N):\n            if seq[i] > seq[j]:\n                res += 1\n    return res\n\ndef naive(N, k, flag):\n    res = 0\n    for p in itertools.permutations(range(N), N):\n        for q in itertools.permutations(range(N), N):\n            if ((p < q) or (not(flag))) and (invnum(p) - invnum(q) > k):\n                res += 1\n    return res\n\nn, mod = map(int, input().split())\n\n# Alternative implementation using generator and accumulator pattern\ndef solve(N, k, flag):\n    invnum_INF = (N * (N - 1)) // 2\n    \n    # Boundary checks\n    if k < -invnum_INF - 1:\n        return solve(N, -invnum_INF - 1, flag)\n    if k >= invnum_INF:\n        return 0\n    \n    # Base case\n    if N == 1:\n        return 0 if flag else (1 if k < 0 else 0)\n    \n    # Accumulate results\n    total = 0\n    for delta in range(-N + 1, N):\n        if flag and delta > 0:\n            continue\n        weight = min(N - delta, delta + N)\n        new_flag = (delta == 0) and flag\n        total = (total + solve(N - 1, k - delta, new_flag) * weight) % mod\n    \n    return total\n\n# Use functools.lru_cache with explicit wrapper\n@lru_cache(maxsize=None)\ndef solve_with_cache(N, k, flag):\n    return solve(N, k, flag)\n\nans = solve_with_cache(n, 0, 1) % mod\nprint(ans)\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <map>\n#include <tuple>\n#include <algorithm>\n#include <cmath>\n\nusing namespace std;\n\nlong long invnum(const vector<int>& seq) {\n    int N = seq.size();\n    long long res = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < N; i++) {\n        for (int j = i + 1; j < N; j++) {\n            if (seq[i] > seq[j]) {\n                res++;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    return res;\n}\n\nlong long solve(int N, long long k, bool flag, long long mod, map<tuple<int, long long, bool>, long long>& memo) {\n    long long invnum_INF = (long long)N * (N - 1) / 2;\n    \n    // Boundary checks\n    if (k < -invnum_INF - 1) {\n        return solve(N, -invnum_INF - 1, flag, mod, memo);\n    }\n    if (k >= invnum_INF) {\n        return 0;\n    }\n    \n    // Base case\n    if (N == 1) {\n        return flag ? 0 : (k < 0 ? 1 : 0);\n    }\n    \n    // Check memoization\n    auto key = make_tuple(N, k, flag);\n    if (memo.find(key) != memo.end()) {\n        return memo[key];\n    }\n    \n    // Accumulate results\n    long long total = 0;\n    for (int delta = -N + 1; delta < N; delta++) {\n        if (flag && delta > 0) {\n            continue;\n        }\n        long long weight = min(N - delta, delta + N);\n        bool new_flag = (delta == 0) && flag;\n        long long sub = solve(N - 1, k - delta, new_flag, mod, memo);\n        total = (total + sub * weight) % mod;\n    }\n    \n    memo[key] = total;\n    return total;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    long long n, mod;\n    cin >> n >> mod;\n    \n    map<tuple<int, long long, bool>, long long> memo;\n    long long ans = solve(n, 0, true, mod, memo) % mod;\n    cout << ans << endl;\n    \n    return 0;\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.75\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.00011598391574807465, -2.861018856492592e-06, -8.344646857949556e-07, -1.9311717551317997e-05, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.0019751342479139566, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -4.410734163684538e-06, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -0.00948045589029789, -7.152555099310121e-07, -4.0531076592742465e-06, -8.344646857949556e-07, -0.0286310575902462, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -5.1616290875244886e-05, -2.3841830625315197e-06, -0.8691084384918213, -0.001503052655607462, -0.009758741594851017, -7.629365427419543e-06, -0.2334328442811966, -0.38687440752983093, -0.632638156414032, -8.106198947643861e-06, -0.38322576880455017, -0.061975233256816864, -0.0017958242679014802, -1.2636104656849056e-05, -3.2186455882765586e-06, -2.145764938177308e-06, -0.165040984749794, -1.2993727978027891e-05, -0.2355603277683258, -7.390948667307384e-06, -0.010596911422908306, -5.960446742392378e-06, -8.487341256113723e-05, -1.9192511899746023e-05, -7.748573807475623e-06, -2.50339189733495e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -7.521823135903105e-05, -3.576278118089249e-07, 0.0, -1.2874520507466514e-05, 0.0, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -0.00020037073409184813, -3.4570634852570947e-06, -3.4570634852570947e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -3.576278118089249e-07, -2.145764938177308e-06, -3.099436753473128e-06, -3.576278118089249e-07, -8.344646857949556e-07, -8.344646857949556e-07, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -3.576278118089249e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -3.576278118089249e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.048587556928396225, -3.576278118089249e-07, 0.0, -3.576272320060525e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -4.768370445162873e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -5.149708886